{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/extras/35db3547f36f4004d52509d8d3befa4c.poster.avif?t=1759195379\" width=480 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/extras/35db3547f36f4004d52509d8d3befa4c.webm?t=1759195379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/extras/35db3547f36f4004d52509d8d3befa4c.mp4?t=1759195379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In an age that\u2019s almost finished\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One More Trail follows one of the last cowboys during the American Frontier. Travel across The West on his final journey to complete his last contract, the trail you ride to get there is yours to control. So saddle up, plot your journey and sally forth, and see what The West still has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/extras/9ed0c4515e41d9d49dc87b60f2d1d22f.poster.avif?t=1759195379\" width=480 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/extras/9ed0c4515e41d9d49dc87b60f2d1d22f.webm?t=1759195379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/extras/9ed0c4515e41d9d49dc87b60f2d1d22f.mp4?t=1759195379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The American Frontier</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One More Trail is a <strong>meditative management RPG</strong> about slowly trekking across the American Frontier Wilderness. <strong>Plot</strong> each leg of the journey on your map, decide where you\u2019ll go and how you\u2019ll get there.<strong> Lead your flock</strong> through vast landscapes, taking care of them throughout the trip. Meet strangers on the trail, each with a strange and distinct personality to explore. Develop relationships with these people through dialogue and acts of service.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the trail, read back through your journey through<strong> The Cowboy\u2019s Journal</strong>, Recontextualising the decisions you made and the places you went along the way. Start the trek again and see what else the West has in store for you, see what changes should you take another route. Lose yourself in the <strong>sprawling vistas of the West</strong>, utilising public domain photography of the American Frontier, enjoy the time period through the eyes of the people who lived it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/extras/fcfa2eb9af6f9548dcc38ab2a8b62034.poster.avif?t=1759195379\" width=480 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/extras/fcfa2eb9af6f9548dcc38ab2a8b62034.webm?t=1759195379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/extras/fcfa2eb9af6f9548dcc38ab2a8b62034.mp4?t=1759195379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully authored version of the American Frontier to explore. Utilising public domain photography.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OMT uses minimal UI, instead favouring diegetic elements, encouraging an immersive and meditative experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Western story with no violence. A story about kindness outliving usefulness, basking in bygone beauty, and dying breeds in pursuit of setting suns. Inspired by real people.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027330?t=1759195379","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/d7bad2a93c5a5ce53976b72e092921b485bd6a94/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759195379","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/327ff78aaf2ea5ee986317d43603dc69d6b16bc1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759195379","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/327ff78aaf2ea5ee986317d43603dc69d6b16bc1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759195379","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"One More Trail focusses on a version of the West not based in Violence. It is meant to be a meditative experience, so we are not looking to shock anyone with intense depictions of any harmful content."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/extras/35db3547f36f4004d52509d8d3befa4c.poster.avif?t=1759195379\" width=480 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/extras/35db3547f36f4004d52509d8d3befa4c.webm?t=1759195379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/extras/35db3547f36f4004d52509d8d3befa4c.mp4?t=1759195379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In an age that\u2019s almost finished\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One More Trail follows one of the last cowboys during the American Frontier. Travel across The West on his final journey to complete his last contract, the trail you ride to get there is yours to control. So saddle up, plot your journey and sally forth, and see what The West still has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/extras/9ed0c4515e41d9d49dc87b60f2d1d22f.poster.avif?t=1759195379\" width=480 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/extras/9ed0c4515e41d9d49dc87b60f2d1d22f.webm?t=1759195379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/extras/9ed0c4515e41d9d49dc87b60f2d1d22f.mp4?t=1759195379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The American Frontier</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One More Trail is a <strong>meditative management RPG</strong> about slowly trekking across the American Frontier Wilderness. <strong>Plot</strong> each leg of the journey on your map, decide where you\u2019ll go and how you\u2019ll get there.<strong> Lead your flock</strong> through vast landscapes, taking care of them throughout the trip. Meet strangers on the trail, each with a strange and distinct personality to explore. Develop relationships with these people through dialogue and acts of service.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the trail, read back through your journey through<strong> The Cowboy\u2019s Journal</strong>, Recontextualising the decisions you made and the places you went along the way. Start the trek again and see what else the West has in store for you, see what changes should you take another route. Lose yourself in the <strong>sprawling vistas of the West</strong>, utilising public domain photography of the American Frontier, enjoy the time period through the eyes of the people who lived it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/extras/fcfa2eb9af6f9548dcc38ab2a8b62034.poster.avif?t=1759195379\" width=480 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/extras/fcfa2eb9af6f9548dcc38ab2a8b62034.webm?t=1759195379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/extras/fcfa2eb9af6f9548dcc38ab2a8b62034.mp4?t=1759195379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully authored version of the American Frontier to explore. Utilising public domain photography.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OMT uses minimal UI, instead favouring diegetic elements, encouraging an immersive and meditative experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Western story with no violence. A story about kindness outliving usefulness, basking in bygone beauty, and dying breeds in pursuit of setting suns. Inspired by real people.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Rat Shed"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/b5e5ab2863296fa5f3886b7c30c4b9f6a8c44ecd/header.jpg?t=1759195379","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4027330/72212688/ad957f46353b579597dc586ea5baca1f268dc74d/1759195049/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759195377","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4027330/72212688/ad957f46353b579597dc586ea5baca1f268dc74d/1759195049/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759195377",