atic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/adb030bfc764966b29847b8a2c6d23214b4bc708/ss_adb030bfc764966b29847b8a2c6d23214b4bc708.600x338.jpg?t=1759195379"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/003d928142bc2f880726adf7e60b2dff271b7d9c/ss_003d928142bc2f880726adf7e60b2dff271b7d9c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759195379","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027330/003d928142bc2f880726adf7e60b2dff271b7d9c/ss_003d928142bc2f880726adf7e60b2dff271b7d9c.600x338.jpg?t=1759195379"}],"short_description":"Follow one of the last Australian cowboys as he fulfils a fateful contract and struggles to find a place in a country that doesn\u2019t need him anymore. Set in the American Frontier at the end of the \u2018Wild West\u2019, plot out his final journey, herd sheep, and form connections with characters in the world.","steam_appid":4027330,"support_info":{"email":"maxwilson@theratshed.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}